  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "0.33333334326744 cup melted butter",
    "2 large eggs",
    "3 tablespoons lemon juice",
    "1.5 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1 teaspoon baking powder",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "0.5 cup milk",
    "1 cup fresh or frozen blueberries",
    "0.5 cup chopped walnuts",
    "2 tablespoons grated lemon zest",
    "0.25 cup white sugar",
    "2 tablespoons lemon juice"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Lightly grease an 8x4-inch loaf pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tfe4tu38FbiLQeKjVULf_xosytI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24843-lemon-blueberry-bread-DDMFS-Step-01-408-48326dafa7474470a76866a69cef3971.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24843/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the batter: Beat sugar, butter, eggs, and lemon juice together in a large mixing bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KCqJWMCNc6QlMq35_AhWh4gv2zU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24843-lemon-blueberry-bread-DDMFS-Step-02-380-022384a741e140688e750cf338c72fc4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24843/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine flour, baking powder, and salt in a separate bowl. Stir into egg mixture alternately with milk. Fold in blueberries, nuts, and lemon zest. Pour batter into the prepared pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/G1Bh7O6xCjql_nD6pifsR7RH5Io=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24843-lemon-blueberry-bread-DDMFS-Step-03-382-13d31a9104954a22a8f82f3f438fa45b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24843/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into the center of the loaf comes out clean, 60 to 70 minutes. Cool bread in the pan for 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zYr9AUQTHEFzSbns_889_2ctyv0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24843-lemon-blueberry-bread-DDMFS-Step-04-399-1ba6bbc254514d08bd1e0c1c613e2b87.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24843/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, prepare the glaze topping: Stir powdered sugar and lemon juice together in a small bowl until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EIPeHJ8XI21np2lLP9ECk4sZlKo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24843-lemon-blueberry-bread-DDMFS-Step-05-400-df03c1add9084c6186854f77bfb59a0c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24843/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove blueberry bread from the pan and drizzle with glaze. Continue to cool on a wire rack.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9B1vh_4kd3eEa33Ill_A3zyQ4fs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24843-lemon-blueberry-bread-DDMFS-Step-06-428-c7fc3f4b323f47b7aaf183a0f33adb08.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24843/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Z0ieodnlMIcnMd0YmE2i-vubjBA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24843-lemon-blueberry-bread-DDMFS-4x3-479-71194648f404470586f087170d030dc4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24843/step_07.webp"
    }
